# Nested SwiftFormat configuration: the ported engine, on top of the root config.
#
# These rules stay on for the app, the helper and their tests; here they would rewrite code that
# is kept as Mac Mouse Fix wrote it (see CLAUDE.md).
#
#   indent                  DragCurve aligns its continuation lines with the derivation
#   yodaConditions          ported comparisons keep the constant where the original put it
#   redundantParens         parentheses group compound conditions, e.g. (dx != 0 || dy != 0)
#   noForceUnwrapInTests    engine tests force-unwrap fixtures the setup just created

--disable indent,yodaConditions,redundantParens,noForceUnwrapInTests
